{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36224","headline":"思越中旧游寄友 · 方干","name":"思越中旧游寄友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甸外山川无越国，依稀只似剑门西。\n镜中叠浪摇星斗，城上繁花咽鼓鼙。\n断臂青猿啼玉笥，成行白鸟下耶溪。\n此中曾是同游处，迢递寻君梦不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}